Contract summary: Northgate Cloud Hosting. The parties are Lumen Labs and Northgate Cloud Hosting GmbH. The contract starts on 1 January 2026 with an initial term of 36 months. The monthly fee is 18,500 euros and is fixed for the first 24 months; after that, increases are capped at 4 percent per year. Payment is due 30 days after the invoice date.
---page---
Service levels and termination. Northgate guarantees an uptime of 99.95 percent per month. If uptime falls below 99.5 percent, the customer receives a credit of 10 percent of that month's fee. Either party may terminate for convenience with 180 days written notice, but only after the first 12 months. Customer data is returned within 30 days of termination. The contract is governed by German law and the place of jurisdiction is Frankfurt.
